:: Prison Tattooed
<<effects>>
<<endevent>>
<<generate_tattooed_inmate 0>><<person1>>
You enter <<tattooed_inmate 0 apo>> cell.

<<for _active_bodypart range setup.bodyparts>>
	<<if !$skin[_active_bodypart].writing>>
		<<set _bodypart_detected to 1>>
	<</if>>
<</for>>
<<if _bodypart_detected is 1>>
	<<He>> gestures you in and asks if you want some ink.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Say yes|Prison Tattooed Choice]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Refuse|Prison Tattooed Refuse]]>><</link>>

<<elseif _bodypart_detected isnot 1>>
	knowing you have no more room for tattoos, <<tattooed_inmate 0>> shoos you out of <<his>> cell.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Prison Walkway]]>><</link>>
<br>
<</if>>

:: Prison Tattooed Refuse
<<effects>>

<<tattooed_inmate 0 apo>> frowns and points toward the cell door.

<<link [[Next|Prison Walkway]]>><</link>>

:: Prison Tattooed Choice

<<for _active_bodypart range setup.bodyparts>>
	<<if !$skin[_active_bodypart].writing>>
		<<set _bodypart_detected to 1>>
		<label>Your <<bodypart _active_bodypart>> <<capture _active_bodypart>><<radiobutton "$tattoo_bodypart" _active_bodypart>><</capture>></label>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</for>>
<br>

<label>Magic Pregnancy <<radiobutton "$tattoo_choice" "magic_pregnancy">></label><br>
<label>Magic Transformation <<radiobutton "$tattoo_choice" "magic_transformation">></label><br>
<label>Magic Wolf Boost <<radiobutton "$tattoo_choice" "magic_wolf_boost">></label><br>
<label>Magic Cat Boost <<radiobutton "$tattoo_choice" "magic_cat_boost">></label><br>
<label>Magic Cow Boost <<radiobutton "$tattoo_choice" "magic_cow_boost">></label><br>
<label>Magic Bird Boost <<radiobutton "$tattoo_choice" "magic_bird_boost">></label><br>
<label>Magic Fox Boost <<radiobutton "$tattoo_choice" "magic_fox_boost">></label><br>
<label>Magic Violence <<radiobutton "$tattoo_choice" "magic_violence">></label><br>
<br><br>
<<link [[Get tattoo (1:00)|Prison Tattooed Get]]>><<prison_rep tattooed 5>><</link>><<gpain>><<gglove>>
<br>
<<link [[Back out|Prison Tattooed Refuse]]>><<unset $tattoo_bodypart>><<unset $writebodyaction>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Tattooed Get

<<effects>>
<<if $tattoo_bodypart and $tattoo_choice>>
	<<tattooed_inmate 0 apo>> pulls out a few items from under their bed. A thin, rolled up piece of metal shaped into a small point, some cut up pieces of cloth, two bottles of liquid, one black, the other a glowing pink color, and a bottle of alcohol.
	<<He>> removes the cap off the alcohol bottle, places a cloth to the mouth of the bottle and briefly tips it over, replacing the cap afterwards. <<He>> then scrubs your $tattoo_bodypart with the cloth.
	<<He>> opens the bottle of black liquid, takes the pointed metal object. dipping it into the liquid, and stabbing it lightly into your skin. <<gpain>>
	<br><br>
	<<He>> intermittently switches from poking your skin with the implement, and scrubbing it with with an alcohol-soaked rag. After a while <<he>> finishes and grabs the bottle of pink liquid.
	<<He>> dips <<his>> fingers into the bottle, and rubs <<his>> fingers along the tattoo <<he>> just made.
	(insert discription of effect).
	<br><br>
	<<He>> says you're free to leave now. you take this opportunity to put your clothes back on.
	<br><br>
	<span class="green">You've gained <<tattooed_inmate 0 apo>> protection.</span><<set $prison.protection to "tattooed">>
	<br><br>
	<<add_bodywriting $tattoo_bodypart $tattoo_choice magic>><<pass 60>><<pain 6>>
	<<link [[Next|Prison Walkway]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $tattoo_choice>>
	<span class="blue">You must choose a body part to tattoo on.</span>
	<br><br>

	<<unset $tattoo_choice>>

	<<link [[Next|Prison Tattooed Choice]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $tattoo_bodypart>>
	<span class="blue">You must choose what you want tattooed.</span>
	<br><br>

	<<unset $tattoo_bodypart>>

	<<link [[Next|Prison Tattooed Choice]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<span class="blue">You must choose a bodypart and image.</span>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Prison Tattooed Choice]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
